	(text "DRDY pin description: Additionally, a \"data ready\" output pin - DRDY pin is\nprovided to indicate to the host that a new conversion has been completed and that\ndata are ready to be read from the device. The host may either use this signal or poll\ndevice register Reg0x00[5] CR bit to determine when new data are available."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
